# Node 20 (2026-08-16). @achrinza/node-ipc — a transitive dependency of
# @vue/cli-service's dev-server stack — declares an `engines` range that
# stops at Node 19. It runs fine on 20; the range is simply stale and the
# package is unmaintained. Yarn treats that declaration as fatal, so this
# downgrades engine mismatches to warnings.
#
# Prefer removing this over living with it: it disappears the day the
# Vue CLI dev server is replaced (Vite) or node-ipc is dropped upstream.
--ignore-engines true
